#: src/onboarding.py:559 src/onboarding.glade:513
msgid "Start face scan"
msgstr "E hoʻomaka i ka nānā maka"

#: src/onboarding.py:559 src/onboarding.py:613
msgid "Scan face model"
msgstr "Kikokikona maka"

#: src/onboarding.py:563
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "ʻAʻole hiki ke mālama i ke ʻano hoʻohālike maka"

#: src/onboarding.py:568 src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "E nānā i ke kŘkohu lua"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "ʻAʻole hiki ke hoʻopaʻa i ke kumu hoʻohālike ʻelua"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. Make sure your"
" face is well lit and centred, then try again -- or skip and add a mod"
"el later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Ua mālama ʻia kāu kumu hoʻohālike mua, no laila ua hana ke komo alo. E"
" hōʻoia i ka mālamalama maikaʻi o kou maka a i waena, a laila e hoʻāʻo"
" hou -- a i ʻole e lele a hoʻohui i kekahi kumu hoʻohālike ma hope mai"
" nā Settings."

#: src/onboarding.py:607
msgid "Add a face model (required)"
msgstr "Hoʻohui i ke ʻano hoʻohālike maka (pono)"

#: src/onboarding.py:609
msgid ""
"Face login needs at least one face model, so this scan can't be skippe"
"d. Record it in the light you usually sit in. Lighting changes how you"
"r face looks to the camera, so consider adding a second model later fr"
"om Settings, recorded in different light (for example evening lamps in"
"stead of daylight)."
msgstr ""
"Pono ka hoʻopaʻa inoa alo i hoʻokahi kumu hoʻohālike maka, no laila ʻa"
"ʻole hiki ke hoʻokuʻu ʻia kēia scan. E hoʻopaʻa iā ia ma ka mālamalama"
" āu e noho mau ai. Hoʻololi ke kukui i ke ʻano o kou helehelena i ka p"
"ahupaʻikiʻi, no laila e noʻonoʻo e hoʻohui i kahi kumu hoʻohālike ʻelu"
"a ma hope mai Settings, i hoʻopaʻa ʻia i nā kukui ʻokoʻa (e like me nā"
" kukui ahiahi ma mua o ke ao)."

#: src/onboarding.py:618
msgid "Add a second face model (recommended)"
msgstr "Hoʻohui i kekahi kumu hoʻohālike maka lua (manaʻo ʻia)"

#: src/onboarding.py:620
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved. Lighting changes how your face looks to the"
" camera: a model recorded in daylight can fail in the evening under la"
"mps (or the other way round), and Ubuntu Hello then times out instead "
"of unlocking. A second model recorded in different light keeps recogni"
"tion reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Mālama ʻia kāu kumu hoʻohālike mua. Hoʻololi ke kukui i ke ʻano o kou "
"helehelena i ka pahupaʻikiʻi: hiki i ke kumu hoʻohālike i hoʻopaʻa ʻia"
" i ke ao ke hāʻule i ke ahiahi ma lalo o nā kukui (a i ʻole ke ʻano ʻē"
" aʻe), a Ubuntu Hello a laila pau ka manawa ma mua o ka wehe ʻana. ʻO "
"ke kumu hoʻohālike ʻelua i hoʻopaʻa ʻia i nā kukui ʻokoʻa e mālama pon"
"o i ka ʻike i kēlā me kēia manawa o ka lā."

#: src/onboarding.py:622
msgid ""
"Change the lighting first: switch the room light or desk lamp on or of"
"f, turn away from the window, or put on the glasses you sometimes wear"
". Then look straight into the camera and press Scan."
msgstr ""
"E hoʻololi mua i ke kukui: hoʻololi a hoʻopau paha i ke kukui lumi a i"
" ʻole ke kukui pākaukau, huli aʻe mai ka puka makani, a hoʻokomo paha "
"i nā aniani āu e ʻaʻahu ai i kekahi manawa. A laila e nānā pololei i k"
"a pahupaʻikiʻi a pēhi iā Scan."

#: src/onboarding.py:660
msgid "Ubuntu Hello Setup"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello Hoʻonohonoho"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware a"
"nd tools..."
msgstr ""
"Hiki iā Ubuntu Hello ke wehe ʻakomi i kāu {} me ka hoʻohana ʻana i ka "
"hōʻoia maka (ʻike ʻia ka ʻeke: {}).\n\n<b>Kulana TPM:</b> Ke nānā nei "
"i nā lako a me nā mea hana TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:693
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Hiki iā Ubuntu Hello ke wehe ʻakomi i kāu {} me ka hoʻohana ʻana i ka "
"hōʻoia maka (ʻike ʻia ka ʻeke: {}).\n\n<b>Kulana TPM:</b> Ua ʻike ʻia "
"ka lako lako TPM. Ke kau 'akomi nei <i>tpm2-tools</i>..."

#: src/onboarding.py:705
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Hiki iā Ubuntu Hello ke wehe ʻakomi i kāu {} me ka hoʻohana ʻana i ka "
"hōʻoia maka (ʻike ʻia ka ʻeke: {}).\n\n<b>Kūlana TPM:</b> Lako Paʻa TP"
"M 2.0 hana. E hoʻopaʻa paʻa ʻia kāu ʻōlelo huna i loko o ka TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Hiki iā Ubuntu Hello ke wehe ʻakomi i kāu {} me ka hoʻohana ʻana i ka "
"hōʻoia maka (ʻike ʻia ka ʻeke: {}).\n\n<b>Kulana TPM:</b> Ua ʻike ʻia "
"ka lako lako TPM, akā ʻaʻole i hoʻokomo ʻia ka <i>tpm2-tools</i>. Holo"
" <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Ke hāʻule hou nei i ka cach"
"ing hōʻoiaʻiʻo ma muli o ka lako polokalamu."

#: src/onboarding.py:709
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Hiki iā Ubuntu Hello ke wehe ʻakomi i kāu {} me ka hoʻohana ʻana i ka "
"hōʻoia maka (ʻike ʻia ka ʻeke: {}).\n\n<b>Kulana TPM:</b> ʻAʻole i ʻik"
"e ʻia ka lako lako TPM. Ke hoʻohana nei i ka hoʻopaʻa ʻana i ka hōʻoia"
" ʻana i ka lako polokalamu (AES-256-GCM)."

