msgstr "Hahai ka ʻŌlelo Aunoa i ka ʻōlelo ʻōnaehana. Hoʻopili koke ʻia nā loli."

#: src/main.glade:725
msgid "Ubuntu Hello"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/main.glade:741
msgid "Facial authentication for Linux"
msgstr "Hōʻoiaʻiʻo maka no Linux"

#: src/main.glade:754
msgid "Version unknown"
msgstr "ʻAʻole ʻike ʻia ka mana"

#: src/main.glade:777
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/ubuntu-hello\">Open GitHub link<"
"/a> "
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/ubuntu-hello\">Wehe i ka loulou "
"GitHub</a>"

#: src/main.glade:809
msgid "About"
msgstr "E pili ana"

#: src/onboarding.glade:35 src/onboarding.glade:43
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello"
msgstr "Welina mai iā Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/onboarding.glade:62
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Ua pau ka hoʻonohonoho ʻana!"

#: src/onboarding.glade:81
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing any"
"thing you would normally have to type your password for to authenticat"
"e, like running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unloc"
"k, your login keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically o"
"n login.\n\nYou can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to cha"
"nge more advanced settings or add additional models. Press Finish belo"
"w to close this window and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Ua pau mākou! Ubuntu Hello i kēia manawa ma kēia kamepiula. E hoʻāʻo e"
" hana i kekahi mea āu e pono ai e paʻi i kāu ʻōlelo huna no ka hōʻoia "
"ʻana, e like me ka holo ʻana i kahi kauoha me sudo. Inā hiki iā ʻoe ke"
" hoʻā i ka wehe ʻana i ke kī kī, e wehe ʻokoʻa ʻia kāu kī kī a i ʻole "
"KWallet ma ke komo ʻana.\n\nHiki iā ʻoe ke wehe i ka Ubuntu Hello Conf"
"igurator ma hope aku e hoʻololi i nā hoʻonohonoho holomua a i ʻole e h"
"oʻohui i nā hiʻohiʻona hou. E kaomi i ka Finish ma lalo e pani i kēia "
"puka aniani a wehe i ka Ubuntu Hello Configurator."

#: src/onboarding.glade:129
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet us"
"ing face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Hiki iā Ubuntu Hello ke wehe ʻokoʻa i kāu kī hoʻopaʻa inoa a i ʻole KW"
"allet me ka hoʻohana ʻana i ka hōʻoia maka, e pale ana i ka ʻōlelo hun"
"a ma hope o ke komo ʻana."

#: src/onboarding.glade:141
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "E hoʻā i ke kī ʻakomi/KWallet wehe"

#: src/onboarding.glade:183
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Hōʻoia i ka ʻŌlelo Huna"

#: src/onboarding.glade:215
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Hoʻonohonoho i kahi kulekele paʻa"

#: src/onboarding.glade:234
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match"
" is never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you "
"can set how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Ma muli o ka hoʻololi ʻana i nā kihi, ka mamao, a me nā mea ʻē aʻe, ʻa"
"ʻole i like ka hoʻohālikelike ʻana i ke alo me ke kumu hoʻohālike i mā"
"lama ʻia. Ma kēia ʻaoʻao hiki iā ʻoe ke hoʻonohonoho i ke koʻikoʻi o U"
"buntu Hello pono."

#: src/onboarding.glade:273
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "wikiwiki"

#: src/onboarding.glade:289
msgid ""
"Allows more fuzzy matches, \nbut speeds up the scanning process greatl"
"y."
msgstr ""
"Hāʻawi i nā pāʻani fuzzy hou aʻe, \nakā, hoʻoikaika nui i ke kaʻina ha"
"na scan."

#: src/onboarding.glade:328
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Kaulike"

#: src/onboarding.glade:344
msgid ""
"Still relatively quick detection, \nbut might not log you in when furt"
"her away."
msgstr ""
"ʻIke wikiwiki nō naʻe, \nakā ʻaʻole paha e hoʻopaʻa inoa iā ʻoe i kahi"
" mamao aku."

#: src/onboarding.glade:383
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Paʻa"

#: src/onboarding.glade:399
msgid ""
"The slightly safer option, \nbut will take much longer to authenticate"
" you"
msgstr ""
"ʻO ke koho palekana iki, \nakā lōʻihi ka lōʻihi o ka hōʻoia ʻana iā ʻo"
"e"

#: src/onboarding.glade:442
msgid "Adding a face model"
msgstr "Hoʻohui i kahi hiʻohiʻona maka"

#: src/onboarding.glade:461
msgid ""
"To authenticate you Ubuntu Hello needs to save a model of your face to"
" recognise you. Press the Scan button below to start the facial scan."
msgstr ""
"No ka hōʻoia ʻana iā ʻoe Ubuntu Hello pono e mālama i kahi kumu hoʻohā"
"like o kou helehelena e ʻike ai iā ʻoe. E kaomi i ke pihi Scan ma lalo"
" no ka hoʻomaka ʻana i ka nānā maka."

#: src/onboarding.glade:538
msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Holo i kēia manawa"

#: src/onboarding.glade:544
msgid ""
"You can add more face models later from Settings or with: sudo ubuntu-"
"hello add"
msgstr ""
"Hiki iā ʻoe ke hoʻohui i nā hiʻohiʻona helehelena hou aʻe ma hope mai "
"Settings a i ʻole: sudo ubuntu-hello add"

#: src/onboarding.glade:577 src/onboarding.glade:668
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Ke hoʻonohonoho nei i ka webcam"

#: src/onboarding.glade:594
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "Ke kukuna nei ka infrared emitter?"

#: src/onboarding.glade:612
msgid "yes"
msgstr "ʻAe"

#: src/onboarding.glade:629
msgid "no"
msgstr "ʻAʻole"

#: src/onboarding.glade:687
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available c"
"ameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list "
"of usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and clic"
"k Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello e ʻimi maʻalahi i kāu ʻōnaehana no nā pahupaʻikiʻi i loaʻ"
"a, no laila e hoʻopaʻa pono i ka pili ʻana o kāu webcam. Ma hope o ka "
"ʻike ʻana e hōʻike ʻia kahi papa inoa o nā webcams hoʻohana. E koho i "
"ka mea āu e makemake ai e hoʻohana a kaomi Next."

#: src/onboarding.glade:709
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Ke hoʻāʻo nei i kāu webcams, e ʻoluʻolu e kali..."

#: src/onboarding.glade:761
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Hoʻoiho ʻana i nā faila ʻikepili"

#: src/onboarding.glade:780
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be"
" able to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the "
"download progress below."
msgstr ""
"Pono ʻo Ubuntu Hello i ʻekolu mau ʻikepili ʻike maka i hoʻomaʻamaʻa mu"
"a ʻia i hiki ke ʻike iā ʻoe, e hoʻoiho ʻia i kēia manawa. Hiki iā ʻoe "
"ke ʻike i ka holomua download ma lalo nei."

#: src/onboarding.glade:801
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Ke hoʻomaka nei e hoʻoiho..."

#: src/onboarding.glade:850
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Welina mai iā Ubuntu Hello!"

#: src/onboarding.glade:866
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Manao"

#: src/onboarding.glade:887
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Na kēia wizard e alakaʻi iā ʻoe ma ke kaʻina hana hoʻonohonoho a hoʻon"
"ohonoho aunoa iā Ubuntu Hello nou. E kaomi aʻe e hoʻomau."

#: src/onboarding.glade:911
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Hoʻopau"

#: src/onboarding.glade:931
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Aʻe"

#: src/onboarding.glade:956
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "Hoʻopau i ka hoʻonohonoho"

#: ubuntu-hello-gtk.desktop.in
msgid "Windows Hello style facial authentication"
msgstr "Windows Hello hōʻoia helehelena"

#: ubuntu-hello-gtk.desktop.in
msgid "face;recognition;authentication;security;lock;"
msgstr "maka, ʻike, hōʻoia, palekana, laka;"
